==============================================================================
[2] verifying the mapping: at the mapped wind, does the mask object?
==============================================================================
    If the shape relation is the only channel, a fit that pays the shape and
    head-rate compensations should cost nothing in misfit. Then the prior is
    genuinely the only thing resisting, and the mapping above is exact.

    U = 2.0 m/s
